
W9999.app

Lanaguage learnning app with top 9000+ words in English, Turkish, Spanish and Russian langs with  English, Turkish, Spanish, Russian and India langs translations as native you can choose
1) After registration you choose the which lang you want to choose from 4 langs for learning and native language from 5 languages
2) In DASHBOARD(Page), you can see Daily Learning words and Daily progress. Everyday day 20 words streak
3) In WORDS (Page) you can see 20 words with native lang translation and you can add more words with pagination 20+. You can set as learned, star, generate ai and copy.
4) In LEARNED (Page) you can see all learning words. * We can add test page for testing learned words
5) In WORDS and LEARNED page you can filter words with part of speech(8 pos), Category(15 cat)
6) In WORDS and LEARNED page, after choosing the words opened Words Detail page
7) In WORDS DETAIL(Page), pos, category, 5 sentences with native translations, and AI generate button
8) In AI TUTOR(Page), after clicking the words, the ai gives an information about the words in your native language.
9) In NOTES(Page) you can create a note, edit, update, delete functions. Also after generating ai, you can directly copy the information to ai.
